  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "簡單ê幸福"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>慈愛</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有歲--ah khah ē要意養生ê資訊kap觀點，退休了後生活單純，食si̍t漸漸用水sa̍h代替油tsìnn，白tsiánn濟過油tsho。厝--裡頭喙愈來愈少，三頓款食自然簡單凊彩。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">自從接觸著「健康五辛素」ê觀念了後，就特別斟酌蔬食小食店；tsiah發現離徛家無偌遠就有三間蔬食自助餐。M̄-nā有新潮ê南洋風味餐、佛緣多元自助餐，mā有古早味ê素食餐，lóng是良心為本、薄利多銷平價leh經營，三間ê風格無sio-siāng。食飯時間一到若激懶屍，貧惰動鼎灶，阮就khuann-khuann仔散步過--去；beh去佗一間，beh食濟食少，看斯當時心情khí-moo giang，家己ngeh kah喙ê菜色，揀一个iap-thiap ê坐位，輕輕鬆鬆就有一頓飽tuh-tuh ê滿足。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">店面lóng真清幽開闊，逐盤lóng是現炒現煮--ê，規十盤tshinn-tshioh-tshinn-tshioh排kah齊齊齊，五彩ê色水芳khuì十足，有夠siânn--人--ê；由在人客ê意思揀四項菜，看beh點白米飯iah五穀飯lóng ē-sái，koh有燒滾滾免費ê湯thang配，kan-na收你60箍niâ，正港是「大碗koh滿墘」粗飽兼營養。啊若無愛食米飯，想beh換湯麵、炒麵、麵猴、水餃、麵線糊……逐項mā lóng好食kah hōo人「呵咾kah ē tak舌」neh。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">店家為beh推廣素食，長期leh優待麵線糊一碗30箍、兩碗50箍。牙tsô無好ê阿母獨獨對麵線糊思思念念，所致阮便若tńg去後頭厝，定著ē順suà kuānn兩碗麵線糊，陪阿母ná tām-sám ná拍lā涼。有tang時仔想beh試食無仝款ê異國料理，就踏入去hit間南洋風味餐店，有椰子漿金瓜麵、tha-má-tooh酸麵、椰子漿咖哩麵、紅燒hiam辣小火鍋……等。價siàu公道，湯頭十足，對小口ê人上適合，免驚食bē完倒掉，拍損人ê mi̍h。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">不而過，阮khah慣勢食米飯，對四phiat一碗湯tsit種組合上tìng意，kah一tshok仔頭家家己sīnn ê招牌hiam菜脯，色、芳、味齊全ê『彩虹餐』，khai小可錢就歡歡喜喜止iau，享受簡單實在ê生活。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsia-ê頭家正港是佛心滿tīnn，良善經營，m̄-nā親切招呼，更加特別ē替人客設想；三間kánn-ná早就約束好勢ê款，驚人客làu空tsuā，in刁工歇無仝日，替羅漢跤仔解決bē少三頓ê問題。感恩tsia-ê頭家用心經營，逐頓tshuân tio̍h時ê mi̍h配，hōo阮深深感受--著，簡簡單單就是上讚ê幸福--lah！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a name='more'></a></span><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgQsVC-0p1HOwRuH42W73hdBDoerO2zS_LLtkDuo-x0AYjX81xYrVT8iX72C5i6zO6n6jDGth8EghNcS9UniFCRsp_BbcLmh04bgbsEFbnwDmnD8ekhzkoWXREYKV6Sfpj8IpBSMWkvBR246uO_jldyLisRspG1KHLWdLdmTxQE-CgIt2uwV8bngUAIcg/s2847/339%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"2847\" data-original-width=\"2000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgQsVC-0p1HOwRuH42W73hdBDoerO2zS_LLtkDuo-x0AYjX81xYrVT8iX72C5i6zO6n6jDGth8EghNcS9UniFCRsp_BbcLmh04bgbsEFbnwDmnD8ekhzkoWXREYKV6Sfpj8IpBSMWkvBR246uO_jldyLisRspG1KHLWdLdmTxQE-CgIt2uwV8bngUAIcg/w450-h640/339%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh83Rx0lqcuN7mYxvSnS4WfMDl3Zmks00Oe1TSAr5OKu6gZKvyOhJukCZIFM4vWT54tAF3GEINH60N40W7v00OL3Gd23AdSb2mMVj7a9FCkMVA4vs5IqYQ2kZ25IAo8AQV3krXs9_gPKUb7ic1Vvuceaj9t4CCUFlkeeD0G7UFkRb9D4kFWhcNVwLtZBQ/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1339%E6%9C%9F_23A.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\